# Global Rules

- Maintain documentation integrity: do not delete existing comments unless requested.
- Always use relative imports within `app` packages or point correctly to `app.*`.
- Do not check in database binaries (`*.db`) or environment configuration files (`.env`).
- Maintain cleanliness of code layout conforming to `.editorconfig` (4 spaces for Python, 2 spaces for JS/TS/JSON).
